STEP 26
# The worm meshing crown-1 is read from the picture.
ADD axle8s-1 55013 darkgray
ADD conn3-2 42003 black
ADD worm-1 4716 lightgray
ADD bush-26 3713 lightgray
# ERROR fixed (found by the motion check): through conn3-2's cross hole the worm shaft would be locked to the frame; it runs through a round hole
CONNECT axle8s-1.axle4~ -> conn3-2.hole1~ TURNS
CONNECT worm-1.axlehole1 -> axle8s-1.axle4 LOCKED
CONNECT bush-26.axlehole1 -> axle8s-1.axle8 LOCKED
MESH worm-1.teeth crown-1.teeth
RATIO worm-1 crown-1 1/24
DOES axle8s-1 CARRIES worm-1
DOES worm-1 DRIVES crown-1
DOES bush-26 LOCKS axle8s-1
DOES axle8s-1 SPINS_ON conn3-2
PATTERN worm_drive
